go is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to applicants with disabilities . See our Jeanne Clery Disclosure of Campus Security Policy and Campus Crime Statistics Act Annual Security Reports AP On-Line Recruit University of California, San Diego Accessibility About California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) Opt-Out Icon Privacy Policy © 2007-2026 The Regents of the University of California. All rights reserved."
